<title>USA: U.S. exchanges set new equity options listings.</title>
<headline>U.S. exchanges set new equity options listings.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Tuesday it will list options on Terex Corp on August 7 and on National Patent Development Corp on August 8.</p>
<p>Also, the Pacific Exchange (PCX) said it will list options on ChoicePoint Inc on August 8 and the Chicago Board Options Exchange said it will list Hambrecht &amp; Quist Inc options on August 12.  </p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols, the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits and specialist or market maker.</p>
<p>Strikes	 Expir	 Pos Lts  Spec/Mkt Maker</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
